text_output=Customer enabling is how we will win. Turning up with a silicon-only roadmap, we won't win. Turning up a software-out silicon, you're guaranteed not to win. And then the last thing I would tell us, you guys, as an organization, is as we grow, there are areas we will need to adapt to.
